        "attribution": "Berry's adiabatic geometric phase and Aharonov's foundational work on quantum phase effects are distinct, highly influential contributions.",
        "maturity": "The effects are conceptually settled and observed in numerous physical systems.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The candidate combines related but historically and conceptually distinct phase phenomena."
        ]
      }
    },
